   ],
   "spoken": "The fianchetto with g3 — an effective, low-theory system against the Qa5 Scandinavian that many opponents in this range have never faced.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "A quiet fianchetto is a practical surprise weapon precisely because it's under-prepared.",
   "plans": "Fianchetto, develop with Nge2, and build the plan."
